<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-TOUR OF THE MEDITERRANEAN FOURTH STAGE PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TOUR OF THE MEDITERRANEAN FOURTH STAGE PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>ANTIBES, France 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in the</p>
<p>218-km fourth stage of the Tour of the Mediterranean on Friday:</p>
<p>1. Massimo Strazzer (Italy) Roslotto 5 hours 11 minutes 24</p>
<p>seconds</p>
<p>2. Jann Kirsipuu (Estonia) Casino</p>
